    "title": "How confident are you in tackling illegal lending?",
    "displayTitle": "",
    "body": "<p><span style=\"color:hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Before we dive into the course, take a moment to reflect on how confident you currently feel about recognising and responding to illegal lending.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">This isn’t a test, and there are no right or wrong answers. It’s just an opportunity to identify the areas where you already feel confident, and the areas where you may want to build your confidence as you progress through this digital learning experience.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">You’ll be asked the same questions again at the end of the course, so you can reflect on whether anything has changed.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Answer honestly, based on your experience right now.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Drag the sliders below to select your confidence levels (1 = Not at all confident, 5 = Very confident).</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "_onScreen": {
      "_isEnabled": false,
      "_classes": "",
      "_percentInviewVertical": 50,
      "_animationName": "",
      "_animationDelay": "delay-0.5s",
      "_animationRepetition": "repeat-1",
