      },
      "_threshold": [
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 1,
            "_high": 1
          },
          "text": "<p>That’s understandable – illegal lending can be hidden, and customers may not always describe it in those terms. This course will help you build a clearer picture of what illegal lending involves and why it matters.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 2,
            "_high": 2
          },
          "text": "<p>That makes sense – illegal lending can be difficult to identify, especially when the lender appears familiar or trusted. This course will help you understand the key features and warning signs.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 3,
            "_high": 3
          },
          "text": "<p>You’ve got a solid starting point. This course will help you strengthen your understanding of how illegal lending operates and how it can affect customers.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 4,
            "_high": 4
          },
          "text": "<p>It sounds like you already have a good foundation. This course will help you sense-check and build on that knowledge, including through realistic scenarios and regional perspectives.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 5,
            "_high": 5
          },
          "text": "<p>That’s great – you may already have a strong awareness of illegal lending. This course can help you refresh your knowledge, explore practical examples and strengthen consistency in your response.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
