    "instruction": "",
    "ariaQuestion": "",
    "disabledBody": "",
    "_attempts": 1,
    "_shouldDisplayAttempts": false,
    "_canShowFeedback": true,
    "_canShowMarking": false,
    "_questionWeight": 1,
    "_recordInteraction": true,
    "_shouldStoreResponses": false,
    "_linkedToId": "",
    "ariaScaleName": "confidence",
    "labelStart": "",
    "labelEnd": "",
    "_scaleStart": 1,
    "_scaleEnd": 5,
    "_scaleStep": 1,
    "_showNumber": true,
    "_showScaleIndicator": true,
    "_showScale": true,
    "_feedback": {
      "title": "",
      "altTitle": "",
      "feedbackSeparator": "",
      "generic": "",
      "_comparison": {
        "lower": "",
        "same": "",
        "higher": ""
      },
      "_threshold": [
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 1,
            "_high": 1
          },
          "text": "<p>That’s okay – the signs of illegal lending are not always obvious. This course will help you recognise behavioural, emotional and financial indicators, even when a customer does not disclose directly.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 2,
            "_high": 2
          },
          "text": "<p>A lot of illegal lending is hidden in everyday relationships and informal arrangements. This course will help you spot patterns and explore concerns sensitively.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 3,
            "_high": 3
          },
          "text": "<p>You’re making progress. This course will help you strengthen your judgement and recognise signs that may be easy to miss in busy or complex customer conversations.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 4,
            "_high": 4
          },
          "text": "<p>It sounds like you already have a strong base. This course will help you build confidence across a wider range of situations, including where the signs are indirect or unclear.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 5,
            "_high": 5
          },
          "text": "<p>That’s a strong position to start from. This course can help you stay alert to different forms of illegal lending and reinforce how to sense-check concerns without making assumptions.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
