      "_threshold": [
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 1,
            "_high": 1
          },
          "text": "<p>That’s understandable – next steps can feel sensitive, especially where there may be fear, coercion or safeguarding concerns. This course will help you understand safe, proportionate action within the boundaries of your role.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 2,
            "_high": 2
          },
          "text": "<p>It can be hard to know what to prioritise in the moment. This course will help you think through referral pathways, safeguarding considerations and how to support customers without adding pressure.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 3,
            "_high": 3
          },
          "text": "<p>You’ve got a good base. This course will help you build confidence in explaining options clearly, using appropriate referral routes and supporting customers to make informed choices.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 4,
            "_high": 4
          },
          "text": "<p>It sounds like you already have a clear sense of possible next steps. This course will help you reinforce good practice, including regional referral pathways and professional boundaries.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 5,
            "_high": 5
          },
          "text": "<p>Great – you may already have experience supporting customers in complex situations. This course can help you refresh your approach and strengthen consistency across different scenarios.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
