      "_comparison": {
        "lower": "",
        "same": "",
        "higher": ""
      },
      "_threshold": [
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 1,
            "_high": 1
          },
          "text": "<p>That’s okay – these conversations can feel difficult, especially when customers are frightened, ashamed or unsure whether they want to act. This course will help you practise a calm, supportive approach.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 2,
            "_high": 2
          },
          "text": "<p>It can be challenging to balance empathy, fact-finding and urgency. This course will help you explore language and techniques that keep the customer feeling safe and in control.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 3,
            "_high": 3
          },
          "text": "<p>You’re in a good place to build from. This course will help you strengthen your approach to listening, asking questions and reducing shame or self-blame.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 4,
            "_high": 4
          },
          "text": "<p>It sounds like you already work hard to create supportive conversations. This course will help you refine that approach in the specific context of illegal lending.</p>"
        },
        {
          "_values": {
            "_low": 5,
            "_high": 5
          },
          "text": "<p>Great – you likely already have strong conversation skills. This course can help you apply those skills to illegal lending scenarios, where fear, loyalty, coercion or stigma may affect what customers feel able to share.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
