    "title": "How confident are you in tackling illegal lending?",
    "displayTitle": "",
    "body": "<p style=\"border:2px solid black;font-size:24px;padding:20px;text-align:center;\">Thanks for answering these questions.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>As you work through the course, you’ll build confidence in recognising illegal lending, spotting warning signs, having supportive conversations and taking safe, proportionate action.&nbsp;<br><br>You’ll also explore how to use referral pathways, follow safeguarding and organisational procedures, maintain professional boundaries and look after your own wellbeing.&nbsp;<br><br>You’ll revisit the same confidence questions at the end of the course, so you can reflect on what’s changed for you.</p><p style=\"border:2px solid black;font-size:24px;padding:20px;text-align:center;\"><strong>When you’re ready, let’s get started and explore what you can do to help customers affected by illegal lending.</strong><br><br><strong>Close this window to exit.&nbsp;</strong></p>",
